 "l15.0c27327a": "`mi tasi miku tu una` (I laugh because you came)",
 "l15.12e52314": "\"if it rained, I didn't go\"",
 "l15.1b94a681": "Tense only in the main clause — the subordinate inherits context.",
 "l15.1f90884a": "`asi pa X, Y` = \"if it weren't for X, Y\".",
 "l15.2e790236": "while",
